{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design and build your own potion shop!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Penny for Your Potion</strong> is a medieval potion shop management game where you build, maintain and run your own potion shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize your shop, harvest ingredients and brew powerful potions, and you'll be ready to welcome your first customers! Pay attention to what they want, keep them happy, build your reputation and unlock exciting ways to expand. Stay committed to building your shop, and your business will flourish in no time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/81208995747ff671ed85cdb26391602a.poster.avif?t=1759834976\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/81208995747ff671ed85cdb26391602a.webm?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/81208995747ff671ed85cdb26391602a.mp4?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Greet Your Customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are tons of stories and secrets to uncover in <strong>Penny for Your Potion</strong>! Listen to your customers, brew potions accordingly, and serve them well. Each person may describe their needs differently, and sometimes more than one potion can be a viable cure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/d05a91436bea655489f1aaab8b42940d.poster.avif?t=1759834976\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/d05a91436bea655489f1aaab8b42940d.webm?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/d05a91436bea655489f1aaab8b42940d.mp4?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix Ingredients to Brew Potions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be greeted with tons of different ingredients in <strong>Penny for Your Potion</strong><i>!</i> Each one contains different elements, combine them to brew exactly what you need! But be careful: some customers may specifically request or avoid certain ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/4cf244bcdff6b2373c7758fd19618cd2.poster.avif?t=1759834976\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/4cf244bcdff6b2373c7758fd19618cd2.webm?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/4cf244bcdff6b2373c7758fd19618cd2.mp4?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Shop How You Like It</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your shop, add lights, create rooms, design your main area, build one room for yourself and one for customers. Start with a small shop and transform it into an amazing building in no time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/05fad6749e1d87626e727fc44089ae49.poster.avif?t=1759834976\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/05fad6749e1d87626e727fc44089ae49.webm?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/05fad6749e1d87626e727fc44089ae49.mp4?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organize Your Shop, Including Your Cupboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just your entire shop, you can even customize smaller details like cupboards. Choose your decorations, design it your way, and build your dream potion shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/83a799ee35568bfb458a82b29545a63b.poster.avif?t=1759834976\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/83a799ee35568bfb458a82b29545a63b.webm?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/83a799ee35568bfb458a82b29545a63b.mp4?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock New Systems as You Progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's always something new to discover in <strong>Penny for Your Potion</strong> as you progress: cut ingredients, mash them, chop down trees and smash stones to unlock new areas and expand your business. Discover the inn, the adventurers' guild, the apprentices and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does Penny for Your Potion offer?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive alchemy shop management,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizing your own shop,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your garden,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brewing potions for your customers,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling system and skill tree,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against a greedy old fellow shopkeeper,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intriguing story including the lives of townfolks and heroes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack featuring  medieval tunes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20-30 hours of playtime,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular updates shaped by your\u00a0<strong>feedback and love</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free updates</strong>\u00a0after launch!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/bb6c9fe26734ca3097a74eac4fee3b2d.avif?t=1759834976\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to wishlist Penny for Your Potion on Steam to be notified when it releases with 20% discount!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560010?t=1759834976","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560010?t=1759834976","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/8e4009595bf6867d0999534b05f3a2274669b7cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759834976","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/8e4009595bf6867d0999534b05f3a2274669b7cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759834976","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":