eds differently, and sometimes more than one potion can be a viable cure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/d05a91436bea655489f1aaab8b42940d.poster.avif?t=1759834976\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/d05a91436bea655489f1aaab8b42940d.webm?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/d05a91436bea655489f1aaab8b42940d.mp4?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix Ingredients to Brew Potions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be greeted with tons of different ingredients in <strong>Penny for Your Potion</strong><i>!</i> Each one contains different elements, combine them to brew exactly what you need! But be careful: some customers may specifically request or avoid certain ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/4cf244bcdff6b2373c7758fd19618cd2.poster.avif?t=1759834976\" width=616 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/4cf244bcdff6b2373c7758fd19618cd2.webm?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/4cf244bcdff6b2373c7758fd19618cd2.mp4?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Shop How You Like It</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your shop, add lights, create rooms, design your main area, build one room for yourself and one for customers. Start with a small shop and transform it into an amazing building in no time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/05fad6749e1d87626e727fc44089ae49.poster.avif?t=1759834976\" width=616 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/05fad6749e1d87626e727fc44089ae49.webm?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/05fad6749e1d87626e727fc44089ae49.mp4?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organize Your Shop, Including Your Cupboards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just your entire shop, you can even customize smaller details like cupboards. Choose your decorations, design it your way, and build your dream potion shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/83a799ee35568bfb458a82b29545a63b.poster.avif?t=1759834976\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/83a799ee35568bfb458a82b29545a63b.webm?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/83a799ee35568bfb458a82b29545a63b.mp4?t=1759834976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock New Systems as You Progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's always something new to discover in <strong>Penny for Your Potion</strong> as you progress: cut ingredients, mash them, chop down trees and smash stones to unlock new areas and expand your business. Discover the inn, the adventurers' guild, the apprentices and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What does Penny for Your Potion offer?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive alchemy shop management,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizing your own shop,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing your garden,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brewing potions for your customers,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling system and skill tree,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against a greedy old fellow shopkeeper,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intriguing story including the lives of townfolks and heroes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack featuring  medieval tunes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20-30 hours of playtime,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular updates shaped by your\u00a0<strong>feedback and love</strong>,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free updates</strong>\u00a0after launch!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560010/extras/bb6c9fe26734ca3097a74eac4fee3b2d.avif?t=1759834976\" width=616 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't forget to wishlist Penny for Your Potion on Steam to be notified when it releases with 20% discount!</strong></p>","developers":["Last Minute Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"de